<tbody> 
<tr style="padding: 0px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"> 
<th style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;"> 
<p class="h2" style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #0071c5; line-height: 19px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;"><span class="eloquaemail"></span></p> 
<p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">
Welcome to the Intel® Partner Alliance program!
<br> 
<br> 
We’re excited to have you join a unified ecosystem designed to enable partners to connect with the Intel ecosystem to accelerate innovative solutions that deliver business outcomes and unlock growth<br> <br> To ensure uninterrupted access to your account,please log in within <b>45 days</b> of receiving this email. Logging in will keep your profile active and tied to your company. </p>
<p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">
With benefits tailored to your business, you’ll be able to:
<ul style="color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">
<li>Drive new business opportunities with the latest tools, training, and resources</li>
<li>Earn and redeem points on eligible purchases and activities</li>
<li>Accelerate marketing and sales success with Market Development Funds</li>
<li>Learn, prototype, and test workloads on the latest Intel® software</li>
<li>Expand knowledge with world-class training in Intel® Partner University</li>
<li>Create innovative products using NDA content, roadmaps, and developer tools</li>
<li>Launch campaigns quickly with co-marketing assets on Intel® Marketing Studio</li>
<li>Gain qualified leads with your partner storefront on Intel® Partner Showcase</li>
</ul>
<p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">
<a href="https://partner.intel.com/s/post-launch-primary"> Log In & Get Started </a>
<br>
<br>
Please click <a href="https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/support/articles/000092340/programs/access-entitlement-for-myintel-users.html?wapkw=mfa__;!!OrxsNty6D4my!4buZDlfdnsvirTD6XYVVBD1pnJ7qKMcJaVV6YzAZElmyQgjpWFG52NW6D3SLA49tvFBtnXgcv5RXUpcFtGHoaFbzfZ4aNs1K_A$"> here</a> if you need help with Intel’s login process.










<p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">
<p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 11px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;"> 
<tr><td style="word-break:break-all;font-size: 11px;color: #555554;font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400;"> 
<br>
Thank you,<br> 
Your Intel® Partner Alliance team</p></td></tr> 
